T	"好。"
T	"Q010 探討 special-population pneumonia pathogen reasoning。"
T	"題目要求評估各族群 common pathogens。"
T	"還要選出 incorrect statement。"
T	"Official answer 是 B。"
T	"Option B 說 nursing-home pneumonia 有一種最常見 pathogen。"
T	"它認為是 Pseudomonas aeruginosa。"
T	"這項 statement 不適當。"
T	"一開始看會覺得困惑。"
